ight_Partners_Name + '</b>) — cannot be edited, deactivated, or deleted</div> <div class="sr_alert_sub">Remove all references listed below before making any changes.</div> <div> <span class="sr_alert_meta">' + totalModules.toString() + ' Module' + if(totalModules > 1,'s','') + '</span><span class="sr_alert_meta">' + totalRecords.toString() + ' Record' + if(totalRecords > 1,'s','') + '</span> </div> </div> <div class="sr_section_title">Referenced In</div> ' + moduleCards + ' </div>';
